        "name": "Sawyer Merritt",
        "text": "SpaceXAI has just introduced Grok @Bot Creator Rewards!\n\nRewards will go out every two weeks. Rewards are based on usage:\n• How many people use your Bots. Are your Bots useful and popular?\n• How often your Bots are used. Are your Bots providing consistent value over time?\n\nFor your templates to be eligible for rewards, you must:\n• Post about your public Bots (and specifically link to them) on X ≥ 2x per pay period\n• Have X Money set up\n• Payouts will be sent as part of X’s Original Content Rewards for now.\n \nIn the last two weeks, I’ve earned $500 in rewards due to people using my Home Robots template 🔥\n\nMore info: https://legal.x.com/en/grok-bot-template-rewards-terms.html",
