        "name": "Your Mom, Dave",
        "text": "Blue Origin is great and if we had nothing to compare it with, we'd be incredibly impressed with what they built, having raised just $30B.\n\nBut let's just use BO to put SpaceX's capital efficiency into perspective;\n\n— SPCX invented the orbital class reusable booster\n— flew + landed it like 650 times\n— built Starlink; 10M+ customers\n— built Dragon; launched like 60 humans to the ISS\n— got ~95% of the way to making a fully reusable Starship operational\n— acquired xAI, positioning them to do Starmind\n\nAll of this on just $10B worth of private equity\n\nLike what the fuck",
